Package: cdcmeasles
Title: Access and Visualize CDC Measles Case Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Doug", "Challener", email = "doug@challener.net", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools to access, analyze, and visualize measles case data
    from the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC). The package
    downloads data directly from official CDC JSON endpoints, offering both weekly
    and historical yearly case counts. Includes functions to check data
    availability, retrieve metadata, and create time series and choropleth map
    visualizations.
